# Keep line endings LF everywhere, including in the working tree on Windows.
# Without this, git checks Go files out as CRLF and `gofmt -l .` reports every
# one of them as unformatted while CI, running on Linux, sees them as fine.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.gif binary
*.jpg binary
*.iso binary
*.exe binary
*.torrent binary
